<db:section xml:id="details">
<db:title>Detailed Description</db:title>
<db:para>This class tests that QDoc marks an explicitly defaulted function as <db:code>constexpr</db:code> only when its declaration says so, either directly or through a macro.</db:para>
</db:section>
